mapping "W7098.1" source="W7098" target="217748000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W7098 = drowning and submersion following fall into natural water, unspecified place,
        other specified activity. Target SNOMED CT 436593 (217748000), the sole standard concept in this
        hierarchy. SNOMED CT has non-standard [X] concepts for place-modified variants (e.g. 40417989,
        occurrence at unspecified place) but no activity-modified variants; all [X] concepts have
        invalid_reason=D in Athena. Parent ICD-10 W70 crosswalks to 436593. The 5-char code adds
        unspecified place + activity detail that no standard SNOMED CT concept captures; the target fully
        subsumes the source but at 3+ levels of hierarchy above. Weak tier: extreme specificity loss
        (mechanism, place, activity all dropped), but subsumption is total and parent
        crosswalk-confirmed.
        """
}
